# ============================================================
# Test app specific gitignore
# Generated/processed assets MUST NOT be committed
# ============================================================

# Processed image variants (resized, format-converted)
# These are generated at build time
public/images/

# Generated manifest
# Consumers choose whether to commit their own manifest
public/static-images.json

# Next.js build artifacts
.next/
out/

# ============================================================
# NOTE: Original source images
# ============================================================
# public/test-images/ is the source of truth for visual tests
# and IS committed to Git. Only the PROCESSED outputs above
# are gitignored.
